NlpIaC1oeXBSSDlNS3dNTXlZRjJ1X3dteHVDQmFFYnFmdTZ6c2NuNFhR?oc=5","date":"2026-11-19","zh":""},{"title":"How Are Logistics Leasing and Data Centers Shaping the Outlook at PLD (NYSE:PLD)?","src":"Kalkine Media","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-11-18","zh":"物流租賃與資料中心如何塑造 PLD（NYSE：PLD）的前景？"},{"title":"Distributed Energy Is Foundational Infrastructure for Growth","src":"Prologis","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxPRHRFeVM5d3R4M25tU29lWTZxc3RrQnlIM21EcW5sR1ZsXzdTNTE2RXE5dFBmeGpldUR5Qjd0bXNSRHZMNlVGeU9DZVRRUkVDRE9yTFk1NnJHMll5UXBydV9vNjQ1cWVEVl9uMkdVRnZyNkszZWtvTDJ5YmR1Zm5aaEFDdEp5T1BRVHBkaHRkRFEzSGxLakV1UWVQVnhNSEhqUHJtSjBRNkZ1NEV5?oc=5","date":"2026-11-17","zh":"分散式能源是成長的基礎設施"},{"title":"REG - Prologis, Inc. - Rule 2.9 Announcement","src":"TradingView","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxQUUc5TVNkeHByZFhYODdYSXM1aVhjZ2lIZmdhdzNJTzNsdFh3N1JrWDV4RmVlYWJ2eDd1bVdGSVNwNzAtSkF4d1lJYkh3TXpqVEtPZEs5UFBYZFl2bEFscE5iZk1ENTdiZjVDS3dGbkhXYzVDYUNUNVo4b2RjRENCcUs1SEZDbkNhSkk5S05aU0g5RU1xeTFSX194Ui1NWnJuYThvZjlKUU12NzRrcG5CQ3FvZjE?oc=5","date":"2026-11-17","zh":"REG - Prologis, Inc. - 規則 2.9 公告"}],"themes":[{"name":"資料中心","count":1},{"name":"能源/電力","count":1},{"name":"減重藥/生技","count":1},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":1},{"name":"併購","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-13","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1045609/000119312526051453/pld-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Prologis, Inc. is a self-administered and self-managed REIT and is the sole general partner of Prologis, L.P. through which it holds substantially all of its assets. We operate Prologis, Inc. and Prologis, L.P. as one enterprise and, therefore, our discussion and analysis refers to Prologis, Inc. and its consolidated subsidiaries, including Prologis, L.P. We invest in real estate through wholly owned subsidiaries and other entities through which we co-invest with partners and investors (\"co-investment ventures\"). We have a significant ownership interest in the co-investment ventures, which are either consolidated or unconsolidated based on our level of control of the entity.","zh":"Prologis, Inc. 是一家自我管理和自我管理的 REIT，並且是 Prologis, L.P. 的唯一普通合夥人，Prologis, L.P. 透過該公司持有其幾乎所有資產。我們將 Prologis, Inc. 和 Prologis, L.P. 作為一家企業經營，因此，我們的討論和分析涉及 Prologis, Inc. 及其合併子公司，包括 Prologis, L.P.。我們透過全資子公司和其他實體與合作夥伴和投資者共同投資（「共同投資企業」）投資房地產。我們在共同投資企業中擁有重大所有權權益，這些企業根據我們對實體的控製程度進行合併或未合併。"},{"en":"Prologis, Inc. began operating as a fully integrated real estate company in 1997 and elected to be taxed as a REIT under the Internal Revenue Code of 1986, as amended (\"Internal Revenue Code\" or \"IRC\"). We believe the current organization and method of operation enable Prologis, Inc. to maintain its status as a REIT. Prologis, L.P. was also formed in 1997.","zh":"Prologis, Inc. 於 1997 年開始作為一家完全一體化的房地產公司運營，並選擇根據 1986 年《國內稅收法》及其修訂版（“《國內稅收法》”或“IRC”）作為 REIT 納稅。我們相信目前的組織和運作方法使普洛斯能夠維持其房地產投資信託基金的地位。 Prologis, L.P. 也成立於 1997 年。"},{"en":"We operate, manage and measure the operating performance of our properties on an owned and managed (\"O&M\") basis. Our O&M portfolio includes our consolidated properties as well as properties owned by our unconsolidated co-investment ventures, which we manage. We make operating decisions based on our total O&M portfolio as we manage the properties without regard to their ownership. We also evaluate our results based on our proportionate economic ownership of each property included in the O&M portfolio (\"our share\").","zh":"我們在擁有和管理（「O&M」）的基礎上營運、管理和衡量我們物業的營運績效。我們的營運與維護投資組合包括我們的合併財產以及我們管理的未合併共同投資企業擁有的財產。我們根據我們的整體營運和維護組合做出營運決策，因為我們管理資產而不考慮其所有權。我們也根據我們對 O&M 投資組合中每項資產的經濟所有權比例（「我們的份額」）來評估我們的結果。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"At December 31, 2025, in our Real Estate Segment representing our consolidated properties, we had more than 4,000 customers occupying 649 million square feet of logistics operating properties (6,500 customers occupying 1.3 billion square feet for our O&M portfolio). Our broad customer base represents a spectrum of international, national, regional and local logistics users who operate across various industries, providing diverse goods to consumers throughout the globe.","zh":"截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，在代表我們合併物業的房地產部門中，我們有超過 4,000 名客戶佔用了 6.49 億平方英尺的物流營運物業（我們的 O&M 投資組合中有 6,500 名客戶佔用了 13 億平方英尺）。我們廣泛的客戶群代表了一系列國際、國家、區域和本地物流用戶，他們跨行業運營，為全球消費者提供多樣化的商品。"},{"en":"The strategic location of our global portfolio gives us a unique ability to provide real estate solutions that support our customers' supply chains and help them meet end-consumer delivery expectations. Our properties are positioned at critical points in the supply chain, most notably our infill and Last Touch facilities, which are located within and adjacent to major cities to ensure same-day delivery to consumers. Additionally, we own import and national distribution centers with access to major seaports and intermodal hubs, as well as regional distribution centers that facilitate broader market reach.","zh":"我們全球投資組合的策略性位置使我們具有獨特的能力，能夠提供房地產解決方案，支援客戶的供應鏈並幫助他們滿足最終消費者的交付期望。我們的物業位於供應鏈的關鍵點，最引人注目的是我們的填充和最後接觸設施，這些設施位於主要城市內或鄰近主要城市，以確保向消費者當天交貨。此外，我們還擁有可通往主要海港和多式聯運樞紐的進口和國家配送中心，以及可促進更廣泛市場覆蓋的區域配送中心。"}],"competition":[{"en":"Real estate ownership is highly fragmented, and we face competition from many owners and operators. Competitively priced logistics space could impact our occupancy rates and limit the rents we can charge, which in turn could affect our operating results, particularly during periods of economic uncertainty or elevated new supply. We also face competition in our capital deployment business from regional, national and global operators and developers, and in our strategic capital business from investment and asset managers seeking institutional capital.","zh":"房地產所有權高度分散，我們面臨許多業主和經營者的競爭。價格具有競爭力的物流空間可能會影響我們的入住率並限制我們可以收取的租金，這反過來又可能影響我們的經營業績，特別是在經濟不確定或新供應增加期間。我們的資本部署業務也面臨來自區域、國家和全球營運商和開發商的競爭，以及來自尋求機構資本的投資和資產管理公司的戰略資本業務的競爭。"},{"en":"Despite this competitive environment, our global reach and local market knowledge, developed over the years, provide us with distinct competitive advantages, including the following:","zh":"儘管面臨這樣的競爭環境，我們多年來累積的全球影響力和本地市場知識為我們提供了獨特的競爭優勢，包括："}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Real Estate Operations","val":8197774000,"zh":"房地產營運部門"},{"name":"Strategic Capital","val":592353000,"zh":"策略資本部門"}],"total":8790127000}},"peers":["PSA","DLR","VMRK","SPG","BXP"]}}